9. CONCLUSION
NeuroFlare is an intelligent AI-powered fire prediction system that combines IoT and Machine Learning to enhance early fire detection. It provides a scalable and cost-effective solution for modern safety applications. The system continuously monitors environmental parameters such as temperature, humidity, and gas levels to estimate fire risk in advance. Using an ESP32 controller and cloud connectivity, it enables real-time monitoring and instant alerts through local alarms and led detections.
